  The rule-engine row is the one that matters: the labels are
  HUMAN annotations (labels.csv -> clip folder -> target_label,
  verified 159/159 exact), so the rule engine is an independent
  competing predictor seeing the SAME window as the model, not
  the source of the labels. Beating it is the evidence that the
  learned model adds something over the hand-coded heuristic.

