--------------------------------------------------------------------------
LABEL PROVENANCE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
These scores are measured against HUMAN tactical annotations
(labels.csv -> clip folder -> target_label; verified 159/159).
They are NOT agreement-with-a-rule-engine: label_clips.py is a
separate path that never wrote these labels, which is why it
appears above as an independent competing baseline.

Remaining honest caveat: single annotator. A second independent
annotator would let inter-annotator agreement be quoted as the
true ceiling for every number here:
    python fyp/annotate.py dataset/dataset --out gold2.csv
    python fyp/ml_classifier.py <csv_dir> --gold gold2.csv

